sists with preparing and filing business formation documents with state authorities. We are not a law firm and do not provide legal advice. State filing fees are separate from our service fees and are paid directly to government agencies. Approval timelines vary by state. We do not guarantee specific processing times or outcomes. You are responsible for reviewing all documents and ensuring accuracy before filing.\"}]]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"div\",\"7. Payment Terms\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"7. Payment Terms\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Fees for services are as specified in your order confirmation or service agreement. Payment is due at the time of order unless otherwise agreed. Accepted payment methods include: credit/debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover), cryptocurrency (Bitcoin, Ethereum, USDC), and ACH bank transfers. All prices are in US Dollars. We reserve the right to change prices with 30 days notice. Late payments may incur a 1.5% monthly finance charge.\"}]]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"div\",\"8. Refund Policy\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"8. Refund Policy\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Refunds are governed by our Refund Policy, which is incorporated into these Terms by reference. Service fees are eligible for a full refund within 14 days if work has not commenced. State filing fees are non-refundable once submitted. Optional services may be cancelled within 7 days for a full refund if unfulfilled. Custom development projects are governed by the refund terms in your specific contract.\"}]]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"9. Intellectual Property\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"9. Intellectual Property\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Wolfitpark retains all rights, title, and interest in our proprietary technology, software, tools, templates, and methodologies. Upon full payment, clients receive ownership of custom deliverables specifically created for their project. You may not reproduce, modify, distribute, or reverse-engineer our proprietary materials without written permission.\"}]]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"10. Confidentiality\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"10. Confidentiality\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Both parties agree to maintain confidentiality of non-public information shared during the course of business. Confidential information includes business plans, financial data, technical specifications, and customer data. This obligation survives termination of our agreement for 5 years.\"}]]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"div\",\"11. Limitation of Liability\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"11. Limitation of Liability\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law: (a) Wolfitpark's total liability for any claim arising from these Terms or our services is limited to the amount you paid us in the 12 months preceding the claim; (b) We are not liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages; (c) We are not liable for damages resulting from government action, regulatory changes, or third-party service failures; (d) We are not liable for delays caused by force majeure events including natural disasters, war, terrorism, or pandemic.\"}]]}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"div\",\"12. Disclaimer of Warranties\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"12. Disclaimer of Warranties\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt